<%= @subject %>

<% if @reminder -%>
You can still rate the pieces from order <%= @order.number %>.
<% else -%>
Your order <%= @order.number %> shipped a little while ago. We'd like to know what you think.
<% end -%>
Pick a rating for each piece. You can add a few words or photos on the next page, or leave it at the stars.
<% @items.each do |item| -%>

<%= item[:name] %><%= " (#{item[:variant_label]})" if item[:variant_label].present? %>
<% item[:stars].each do |star| -%>
  <%= star[:rating] %> out of 5: <%= star[:url] %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

Open your review page: <%= @review_url %>
<% if @points -%>

Members earn <%= @points %> points for every review<%= ", plus #{@photo_bonus} with a photo" if @photo_bonus %>, whatever the rating.
<% end -%>

This link is just for you<%= " and works until #{l(@expires_on, format: :long)}" if @expires_on %>.
Don't want these emails? Stop review emails: <%= @opt_out_url %>
